stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Detected : evaluation verdict gap/contradiction
    Detected --> NeedsHumanReview : low confidence / contradiction / span mismatch
    NeedsHumanReview --> Open : analyst confirms
    NeedsHumanReview --> Dismissed : analyst rejects (false positive)
    Detected --> Open : auto-confirmed (verification gate passed)

    Open --> Acknowledged : firm acknowledges
    Acknowledged --> InRemediation : remediation item assigned
    InRemediation --> InRemediation : remediation_events appended
    InRemediation --> Resolved : re-evaluation verdict pass
    Open --> Waived : risk accepted (documented, audited)
    Acknowledged --> Waived : risk accepted

    Resolved --> Open : regression on later run (NEW_GAP)
    Waived --> Open : waiver expired / reg change invalidates
    Open --> Worsened : severity rank increased on rerun
    Worsened --> InRemediation : remediation re-prioritized

    Dismissed --> [*]
    Resolved --> [*] : retained append-only for audit

    note right of Worsened
        NEW_GAP / WORSENED emit real-time
        alerts with dedupe_key.
        IMPROVED / RESOLVED go to digest.
    end note
    note right of Resolved
        Status transitions journaled;
        evaluations never mutated.
    end note
